{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/qqAl1vjdslw_-RPY5Zqoew","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:30.601754+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/qqAl1vjdslw_-RPY5Zqoew","html":"<div><section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/fEVD6dIibanahQAGiayYia6DiaS9NMIk39uHfmuE2VxxwEVfGuSc6gQC78Wy3pczl9vstwLBL9yBVtJpJ0sFI83iblw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>2025</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>优秀大学生夏令营</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span><span>华东师范大学心理与认知科学学院</span></span></span><span><br/></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/fEVD6dIibanahQAGiayYia6DiaS9NMIk39uHeXb4QALXSmClTNSDA4yPEgJNhw65iciaOOicpm9wmGJGGxynia687rnYeg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/fEVD6dIibanahQAGiayYia6DiaS9NMIk39uHeXb4QALXSmClTNSDA4yPEgJNhw65iciaOOicpm9wmGJGGxynia687rnYeg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span>本次活动旨在让营员们充分了解我院学科发展、优质导师队伍、科学研究平台等，吸引优秀大学生来我院继续深造，鼓励校际交流，创新拔尖人才选拔机制，逐步建立健全与培养质量、学科水平、专业特色相联系的充满生机与活力的学位与研究生教育体系。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/fEVD6dIibanahQAGiayYia6DiaS9NMIk39uHTpFficka0KeD8DGv4wHX77KYP3SxBnGZwyspbDPcGF24jXaEhyIvzug/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span> 夏令营</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>活动主题</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span>智能时代下的心理学研究与实践应用</span></strong></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>举办单位</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><ul><li><p><span>华东师范大学心理与认知科学学院</span></p></li><li><p><span>上海市脑功能基因组学重点实验室</span></p></li><li><p><span>上海市心理健康与危机干预重点实验室</span></p></li><li><p><span>教育部心理学拔尖学生培养模式改革虚拟教研室</span></p></li></ul></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>举办时间及地点</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><p><span>本次夏令营活动分为两个阶段。第一阶段为线上环节，通过学术报告、营员互动，让营员充分了解学院研究生培养特色以及导师研究方向等；第二阶段为线下环节，通过科研平台参观、基地研学、小组研讨等多种方式，让营员进一步了解学院的研究生培养资源与特色，促进导师和学生的双向了解等。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>具体时间及地点如下：</span></p><p><strong><span>第一阶段（线上环节）</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>时间：2025年7月3日至7月4日</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>形式：线上会议</span></strong></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span>第二阶段（线下环节）</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>时间：2025年7月9日至7月10日</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>地点：上海市普陀区中山北路3663号华东师范大学俊秀楼</span></strong></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>营员招生与名额</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>1</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名条件</span></strong></p></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>面向全国高等院校（含本校）有志攻读博士、硕士研究生的优秀2022级（拟2026年夏毕业）在校本科生。报名条件如下：</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>1)拥护中国共产党的领导，品德良好，遵纪守法，遵守学术道德规范。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>2)热爱心理学，</span><strong><span>有志于从事心理学及相关领域的基础研究和实践应用研究工作</span></strong><span>，有较强的研究潜力和创新能力，立志成为博士层次学术创新型人才或高层次实践创新型人才。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>3)专业为心理学、生物学、计算机科学、物理学、数学或其他与心理学相关专业。在本科期间参与过科研项目，在学术期刊上发表过论文，或在全国重大竞赛中获奖者优先，</span><strong><span>有直博意向者优先</span></strong><span>。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>4)学习成绩优异，本科前三年学习成绩在同专业同届学生中排名在前20％，能够获得所在学校推荐免试资格者优先。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>5)具有较强的英语听说和写作能力（全国大学英语六级460分以上，或托福80分以上，或雅思5.5分以上）。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>2</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名程序与材料提交</span></strong></p></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>1)申请参加我院“优秀大学生夏令营”的学生需在</span><span><strong><span>2025年6月30日8:00</span></strong></span><span>前在“华东师范大学研究生报考服务系统”（https://yjszs-ks.ecnu.edu.cn/logon?zsxm=4）中进行网上报名，完整填写各项信息并按要求提交材料。纸质材料无需邮寄，待后续通知再按要求现场提交。申请材料（f）请发至邮箱：ecnupsy_summer@163.com，邮件名及视频名为：【学硕/专硕/直博】暑期夏令营申请材料+姓名。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>2)报名流程：</span></p><p><span>    a)注册。进入报名页面后，请先注册，注册时务必填写真实有效信息。每位申请人最多可注册2个报名号、填报2个申请志愿。未入围的志愿在报名时段内可改报其他志愿。</span></p><p><span>    b)填写报名信息。根据系统提示，逐一填写报名信息，填写完毕并确认无误后，点击“确认并提交”，报名完成。</span></p><p><span>    c)在院系报名截止时间前，可自行撤销提交并修改报名信息，报名时间截止后不可更改。申请完成后，可以查看申请状态与结果。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>3)提交材料：</span></p><p><span>    a)居民身份证。请上传本人有效期内的居民身份证正反面，PDF格式。（<a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/qqAl1vjdslw_-RPY5Zqoew\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>夏令营诚信承诺书（2025）.pdf</span></a>。请保存下载、打印、本人签名后扫描PDF格式上传）。</span></p><p><span>    b)《华东师范大学优秀大学生夏令营申请表》（报名系统自动生成）。请下载、打印、本人签名后扫描PDF格式上传。</span></p><p><span>    c)本科成绩单1份（前5学期），加盖学校教务处或院系公章。</span></p><p><span>    d)两封专业任课教师推荐信，需要副教授及以上职称专家推荐（需专家手写签名）。</span></p><p><span>    e)其他证明材料：合成一个PDF，首页列出所含材料目录，包括：英语等级证书、科研经历的相关证明，如发表的论文、科研项目立项书、专利发明、各类获奖或资格证书等材料的复印件。</span></p><p><span>    f)提供一段5分钟视频，须为MP4格式且小于100MB，内容至少包含自我介绍、对报考专业的了解和希望研究的主要问题，以及未来发展规划。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>3</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>营员名额</span></strong></p></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>第一阶段（线上环节）：150名优秀大学生，其中学术学位、专业学位各75人。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>第二阶段（线下环节）：60名营员，其中学术学位、专业学位各30人。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>具体招生方向见附件，实际入营人数将根据报名情况适当调整。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>4</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>营员遴选</span></strong></p></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>根据申请人情况进行审查、筛选，择优入营。选拔结果后续将会以邮件或电话形式通知相关学生，申请人也可在考生服务系统中查看选拔结果。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>日程安排</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><p><span>本次夏令营初步日程安排如下（实际以夏令营手册公布的为准）：</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/fEVD6dIibanahQAGiayYia6DiaS9NMIk39uHKNfWDoKtiboQUwGf65mtSZCWia0QNRILBj4UfOlH1cf7uImYc50w0X7w/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>营员待遇</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><p><span>1.拟在线下阶段评选优秀营员，评选规则等另行通知。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>2.提供夏令营线下阶段校内用餐和住宿。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>3.购买夏令营线下阶段的保险。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>其他事宜</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><p><span>1. 营员入选后须全程参与夏令营的各项活动。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>2. 申请者必须保证所提交申请材料的真实性和准确性。在任何阶段，如发现申请者存在身体健康状况不符合规定、思想政治素质和品德考核未通过、提供虚假材料或有违规、作弊行为以谋取利益的情况，一经查实，将取消其获取的资格及相应结果。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>3. 联系信息：</span></p><p><span>学术学位：周老师</span></p><p><span>电子邮箱：yzhou@psy.ecnu.edu.cn</span></p><p><span>电话：021-62233433</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>专业学位：郭老师</span></p><p><span>电子邮箱：qguo@psy.ecnu.edu.cn</span></p><p><span>电话：021-62232900</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>4. 关于夏令营各项事宜，如有变化，将会及时公告，敬请关注我院官方网站http://psy.ecnu.edu.cn及微信公众号。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/fEVD6dIibanahQAGiayYia6DiaS9NMIk39uHTpFficka0KeD8DGv4wHX77KYP3SxBnGZwyspbDPcGF24jXaEhyIvzug/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span> 学院简介</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>华东师范大学心理与认知科学学院</span></strong></span><span>前身为1951年成立的华东师大教育系心理学教研室；1979年成立心理学系，是新中国第2个心理学系；2008年成立心理与认知科学学院。为国务院学位委员会批准的首批博士、硕士学位授权点单位，拥有一级学科博士点和硕士点，设有博士后流动站。拥有国家重点学科、国家理科基地、国家级实验教学示范中心、教育部高等学校特色专业、2个国家级一流本科专业建设点、国家基础学科拔尖学生培养计划2.0基地、上海市一流学科，是上海市脑功能基因组学重点实验室、上海市心理健康与危机干预重点实验室、上海市人文社科（心理学）基地依托单位。拥有2个国家级教学团队，12门各类国家级精品课程。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>其他信息详见学院官网：</span></p><p><span>http://psy.ecnu.edu.cn</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/fEVD6dIibanahQAGiayYia6DiaS9NMIk39uHTpFficka0KeD8DGv4wHX77KYP3SxBnGZwyspbDPcGF24jXaEhyIvzug/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span> 研究生招生方式与方向</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>（一）学术学位招生方向与类别</span></strong></p><p><span>学术学位硕士招生涵盖12个招生方向，学术学位博士研究生（直博生）招生涵盖4个专业，具体如下：</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span>学术学位硕士研究生招生方向</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>（招生学科：077100 心理学）</span></strong></p><p><span>1. 感知觉、注意选择与运动控制</span></p><p><span>2. 记忆、奖赏与认知控制</span></p><p><span>3. 心理测量与心理评估</span></p><p><span>4. 语言、脑智与发展</span></p><p><span>5. 发展障碍与心理病理学</span></p><p><span>6. 情绪、情感与社会神经科学</span></p><p><span>7. 个性与社会性发展</span></p><p><span>8. 创造性发展与创新教育</span></p><p><span>9. 社会认知与社会心理学</span></p><p><span>10. 健康与临床心理学</span></p><p><span>11. 行为决策与组织管理心理学</span></p><p><span>12. 人工智能、虚拟现实与人机交互</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span>学术学位博士研究生招生专业（直博生）</span></strong></p><p><span>1. 基础心理学</span></p><p><span>2. 认知神经科学</span></p><p><span>3. 发展与教育心理学</span></p><p><span>4. 应用心理学</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span>（二）专业学位招生方向与类别</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>（招生学科：045400 应用心理）</span></strong></p><p><span>专业学位硕士招生涵盖4个招生方向，具体如下：</span></p><p><span>1. 临床与咨询心理学</span></p><p><span>2. 工业与组织心理学</span></p><p><span>3. 人因工程与用户体验</span></p><p><span>4. 学校心理学</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><span>初审｜李先春</span></p><p><span>终审｜方   媛</span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/fEVD6dIibanahQAGiayYia6DiaS9NMIk39uHJR4SDUQpWzicLneBA1SzFNdAjaMoA6JyJOvKwBVQCeXn5KPHkria3m6g/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/fEVD6dIibanahQAGiayYia6DiaS9NMIk39uHicxvAhSeepibaoMXw6yHHSN5K2r14ySOgzMkfLUmuotUBBGaiaS0tH1gw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/fEVD6dIibanahQAGiayYia6DiaS9NMIk39uH4fPricNh1s3VGCIgib6oS0ib1sPsjRia7Er3xxby2WQ3ITvmzmjjWqJCXw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/fEVD6dIibanahQAGiayYia6DiaS9NMIk39uHWJfgfnAOFZN3ODaM07vK4moSiaTegQ9oJMPomkbSSRJyANLh1NeIHfA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"c434154fd8d2db4139f06157a2a0b4cec98a3f8476b0311e557af531c268ecd2","textLength":2919,"sourceSha256":"d19a1e18a0713f358f989ab06d6c435ad327bcee7e969909de9eecc74f2ce3d3","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-dc5a2e39506cef9ece12","title":"2025年华东师范大学心理与认知科学学院2025年优秀大学生夏令营","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:30.601754+00:00"}
